<td id="S2.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S2.T1.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:241.5pt;">
<span id="S2.T1.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Established news outlets (news, times, post, journal)</span>
</span></td></tr>
